# Alt interrupts both Ctrl overload taps, so neither emits Esc.
0 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
0 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
50 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
50 out key KEY_LEFTALT down
100 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK up
100 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
150 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
150 out key KEY_LEFTALT up
200 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
200 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
250 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
250 out key KEY_LEFTALT down
300 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
300 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
350 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
350 out key KEY_LEFTALT up
